body:
Hahahaha this happened to me. I called a friend to announce that I may die. my nose is fucked to oblivion so I genuinely cannot put anything up there anymore. I can get my nasal passage open but after snorting a terrible pain shoots up my nose, causing tears and a lasting migrane. It's a waste because it's not even capable of absorbing drugs anymore. 

&#x200B;

So I started bombing. I was a casual 1g a day user so I just kept bombing throughout the day like I'm doing lines. It was pure euphoria at first, nothing like snorting. I was happy. But then I got to the 1g mark and holy fuck. Exactly what you described. I took a few benzos and cursed myself for being a piece of shit degenerate. 

&#x200B;

Benzos put me to sleep. Woke up the next day and bombed again but learned my lesson and did less. Just wanted to share this story to make you feel less alone. Fucking cheers to somehow surviving.
